{# Фіча 021: «Крістал: фільтри». Автоекранування в OpenCart вимкнене: назви з БД уже закодовані ядром, текст із PHP — через |e. #}
{{ header }}{{ column_left }}
<div id="content">
  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="container-fluid">
      <div class="pull-right">
        <a href="{{ filters_href }}" class="btn btn-default"><i class="fa fa-filter"></i> {{ button_filters }}</a>
        <a href="{{ back }}" data-toggle="tooltip" title="{{ button_cancel }}" class="btn btn-default"><i class="fa fa-reply"></i></a></div>
      <h1>{{ heading_title }}</h1>
      <ul class="breadcrumb">
        {% for breadcrumb in breadcrumbs %}
        <li><a href="{{ breadcrumb.href }}">{{ breadcrumb.text }}</a></li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="container-fluid">
    {% if error_warning %}
    <div class="alert alert-danger alert-dismissible"><i class="fa fa-exclamation-circle"></i> {{ error_warning }}
      <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="alert">&times;</button>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
    {% if success %}
    <div class="alert alert-success alert-dismissible"><i class="fa fa-check-circle"></i> {{ success }}
      <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="alert">&times;</button>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
    <div class="alert alert-info"><i class="fa fa-info-circle"></i> {{ text_note }} {{ text_values|format(groups_count, values_count) }}</div>

    <div class="panel panel-default">
      <div class="panel-heading"><h3 class="panel-title"><i class="fa fa-magic"></i> {{ text_seed }}</h3></div>
      <div class="panel-body">
        <p class="help-block">{{ text_seed_help }}</p>
        {% if seed_log %}<div class="alert alert-warning">{{ seed_log }}</div>{% endif %}
        {% if seed_preview %}
          {% if seed_plan %}
          <p>{{ text_seed_plan|format(seed_pairs) }}</p>
          <div class="table-responsive">
            <table class="table table-bordered table-condensed">
              <thead><tr><th>{{ column_group }}</th><th>{{ column_value }}</th><th class="text-right">{{ column_products }}</th></tr></thead>
              <tbody>
                {% for group in seed_plan %}
                {% for value in group.values %}
                <tr>
                  <td>{% if loop.first %}<b>{{ group.name|e }}</b>{% if not group.exists %} <span class="label label-success">{{ text_seed_new }}</span>{% endif %}{% endif %}</td>
                  <td>{{ value.name|e }}{% if not value.exists %} <span class="label label-success">{{ text_seed_new }}</span>{% endif %}</td>
                  <td class="text-right">{{ value.products }}</td>
                </tr>
                {% endfor %}
                {% endfor %}
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
          {% if seed_skipped %}
          <p><b>{{ text_seed_skipped }}:</b></p>
          <ul>{% for s in seed_skipped %}<li>{{ s.attribute|e }}: {{ s.texts|e }}{% if s.more %} … +{{ s.more }}{% endif %}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
          {% endif %}
          <form action="{{ seed_apply }}" method="post" style="display:inline-block">
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary"><i class="fa fa-check"></i> {{ button_seed_apply }}</button>
          </form>
          {% else %}
          <p>{{ text_seed_empty }}</p>
          {% endif %}
        {% else %}
        <a href="{{ seed_preview_href }}" class="btn btn-default"><i class="fa fa-eye"></i> {{ button_seed_preview }}</a>
        {% endif %}
        {% if seed_log %}
        <form action="{{ seed_undo }}" method="post" style="display:inline-block" onsubmit="return confirm('{{ text_confirm|e('js') }}');">
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-danger"><i class="fa fa-undo"></i> {{ button_seed_undo }}</button>
        </form>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="panel panel-default">
      <div class="panel-heading"><h3 class="panel-title"><i class="fa fa-th-list"></i> {{ text_assign }}</h3></div>
      <div class="panel-body">
        <p class="help-block">{{ text_assign_help }}</p>
        <form action="{{ assign_action }}" method="get" class="form-inline">
          <input type="hidden" name="route" value="extension/module/kristal_filter/assign">
          <input type="hidden" name="user_token" value="{{ user_token }}">
          <select name="category_id" class="form-control" required>
            <option value="">{{ text_select }}</option>
            {% for category in categories %}<option value="{{ category.category_id }}">{{ category.name }}</option>{% endfor %}
          </select>
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-default">{{ button_open }}</button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="panel panel-default">
      <div class="panel-heading"><h3 class="panel-title"><i class="fa fa-search"></i> {{ text_pages }}</h3></div>
      <div class="panel-body">
        <p class="help-block">{{ text_pages_help }}</p>
        {% if pages %}
        <div class="table-responsive">
          <table class="table table-bordered table-hover">
            <thead><tr><th>{{ column_category }}</th><th>{{ column_filters }}</th><th>{{ column_keyword }}</th><th>{{ column_h1 }}</th><th>{{ column_status }}</th><th class="text-right">{{ column_action }}</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
              {% for page in pages %}
              <tr>
                <td>{{ page.category }}</td>
                <td>{{ page.filters }}</td>
                <td><code>{{ page.keyword }}</code></td>
                <td>{{ page.h1 }}</td>
                <td>{{ page.status ? text_enabled : text_disabled }}</td>
                <td class="text-right" style="white-space:nowrap">
                  <a href="{{ page.edit }}" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" data-toggle="tooltip" title="{{ button_edit }}"><i class="fa fa-pencil"></i></a>
                  <form action="{{ page.delete }}" method="post" style="display:inline" onsubmit="return confirm('{{ text_confirm|e('js') }}');"><button type="submit" class="btn btn-danger btn-sm" title="{{ button_delete }}"><i class="fa fa-trash-o"></i></button></form>
                </td>
              </tr>
              {% endfor %}
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        {% else %}
        <p>{{ text_pages_empty }}</p>
        {% endif %}
        <a href="{{ page_add }}" class="btn btn-primary"><i class="fa fa-plus"></i> {{ button_page_add }}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
{{ footer }}
